Subject: [PATCH 04/35] feat(label_topology_audit): locate holes, write hole
 masks for fix_holes

- locate_holes: background blobs that a 3-step closing fills and whose
  filling lowers the component's b1, screened by local Euler change and
  measured against the running fill so one loop is never counted twice
- b1 split into b1_face (located holes centred within 6 voxels of a
  crop face), b1_interior (the rest) and b1_unlocated (too wide to
  locate, counted as interior); the old 6-voxel trim perforated sheets
  near a face and invented holes
- --hole-masks writes <crop>.hole_mask.tif in the format
  scripts/fix_holes.py reads; --plot adds <crop>.holes.png tiles
- docs: proofreading workflow (audit -> ranked.csv -> fix_holes ->
  --after), located-hole numbers, before/after with fix_holes on the
  10 worst Kaggle crops
