From a620aca9e582adef94f8f25931f19e65aebcb781 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wittmoon <jmoon@lunarink.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:10:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/35] feat(label-topology-audit): read zarr input with a
 window, tiles and a threshold

--label/--after/--image accept a zarr array or OME-Zarr group (local path or
http(s) URL) as well as .tif. --roi reads a window lazily, --tile N audits it
as N-voxel cubes with aggregate.csv and ranked.csv like --batch, --level picks
a pyramid level and --threshold binarises probability volumes and 0/255 masks.
Lets the audit run on community surface predictions published as zarr without
converting them. Four tests cover ROI parsing, tiling and the zarr CLI path.
---
