vesuvius.surface_placement_audit samples a VolCart obj (local or URL, read by
byte range) or a tifxyz surface, reads the CT along the stored normal from a
zarr, and reports the signed offset to the nearest density peak per sample and
per patch, with --fail-on limits, a samples csv and an aggregate csv.

