From 9ae3812997806a4e0e86344bd09f2705abbb1117 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wittmoon <jmoon@lunarink.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:08:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/35] fix(label-topology-audit): islands are not repairs;
 corner contact with ignore voxels opens a component

A closing fill cut off from the sheet by blocked voxels raised the Euler
number without closing a loop, and b1 (computed with b0 = 1) appeared to
drop, so the audit reported a located hole and fix_holes a repair where
the loop was still open. Fills must touch the sheet.

Ignore voxels were dilated with 6-connectivity while components use 26,
so a component touching ignore only at a corner was reported closed.

Two regression tests.
---
