n_grid_holes / grid_hole_points count 4-connected invalid groups that do
not touch the grid border (a flattening whose quality filter punched
holes through the surface, PR #2128, passes a step check and exits 0).
outside_volume_frac is reported and the audit warns when more than 10%
of sampled points fall outside the volume: that is a coordinate-frame
problem (missing downscale or physical scale, PRs #2112 and #2137), not
misplacement, and the offsets mean nothing until the metadata is fixed.
