the audit's rank order (order.txt), a CT image layer sits under the label
when <crop>_img.tif is present (--image-suffix), and --suffix2 is optional.

review_holes.py stages the CT, the hole list and the rank order next to the
label and hole mask, and --stage-only stages the top crops without asking.

