 layout too

--export-training now also writes images/<id>.tif and labels/<id>_<target>.tif
(docs/data_formatting.md layout) next to the .npz bundles, with the verdict
applied to the label cube: FILL hole -> 1, CUT -> unchanged, UNCLEAR -> the
ignore value. New flags --target (surface) and --ignore-value (2); provenance
records both. Test extended; doc step 3b updated.
